    args: [{ selector: "xh-reseller-program-content", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, template: '<div class="vmc-body reseller-body"><div class="wrap">\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Overview \u2014 What is the XcellHost Cloud Channel Partner Program?</div>\r\n  <div class="pp-cols reseller-overview-copy"><p class="pp-ov">The <b>XcellHost Cloud Channel Partner Program</b> lets agencies, MSPs, IT consultants and entrepreneurs sell a full catalogue of cloud, security and AI services \u2014 without building any of it. You get wholesale pricing, optional white-label branding, and a single partner portal to provision services, manage clients and track your earnings.</p><p class="pp-ov">Add new revenue streams overnight: resell what your customers already need, set your own margins, and earn recurring commissions on every renewal. XcellHost handles infrastructure, uptime and 24\xD77 support behind the scenes \u2014 you own the customer relationship, with GST-compliant billing throughout.</p></div>\r\n  <div class="prov-strip"><span class="prov-lbl">Resell</span><span class="prov">Cloud &amp; Hosting</span><span class="prov">Cybersecurity</span><span class="prov">Microsoft 365</span><span class="prov">WhatsApp API</span><span class="prov">Email &amp; Domains</span><span class="prov">Websites &amp; More</span></div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Apply \xB7 Onboard \xB7 Sell &amp; earn \u2014 how the program works</div>\r\n  <div class="pp-vgrid"><article class="vcard dv"><span class="vb">01 \xB7 Apply</span><h3>Sign up free</h3><p>Fill in a short application. There are no setup fees or minimum commitments.</p><ul><li>Free to apply</li><li>No setup fees</li><li>Quick approval</li></ul></article><article class="vcard ov"><span class="vb">02 \xB7 Onboard</span><h3>Get your portal</h3><p>We set up your portal, partner pricing and optional branding, then walk you through the catalogue.</p><ul><li>Partner portal access</li><li>Wholesale pricing applied</li><li>Optional white-label</li></ul></article><article class="vcard ev"><span class="vb">03 \xB7 Sell &amp; earn</span><h3>Grow your revenue</h3><p>Sell at your own prices, provision in a few clicks and earn recurring commissions.</p><ul><li>Set your own margins</li><li>One-click provisioning</li><li>Recurring commissions</li></ul></article></div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Partner levels</div><p class="pp-ov intro-note">Everyone starts as a Registered Partner \u2014 free to join. As your sales grow, you unlock better margins and more benefits.</p>\r\n  <div class="pgrid"><article class="pcard"><div class="ptop"><span class="tierbadge">Level 1</span><span class="tagchip">Free</span></div><h3>Registered</h3><p class="pdesc">Start reselling straight away with standard partner margins.</p><ul class="pfeat"><li>Full catalogue access</li><li>Standard partner margins</li><li>Partner portal &amp; billing</li><li>Email &amp; chat support</li></ul><button class="buy-btn" type="button" (click)="apply()">Sign up</button></article><article class="pcard hot"><div class="ptop"><span class="tierbadge">Level 2</span><span class="tagchip best">Most popular</span></div><h3>Silver</h3><p class="pdesc">Better margins and white-label branding as your volume grows.</p><ul class="pfeat"><li>Everything in Registered</li><li>Higher margins</li><li>White-label branding</li><li>Priority and co-marketing support</li></ul><button class="buy-btn" type="button" (click)="apply()">Sign up</button></article><article class="pcard"><div class="ptop"><span class="tierbadge">Level 3</span><span class="tagchip">By invitation</span></div><h3>Gold</h3><p class="pdesc">Best margins, a dedicated manager and deal support for top partners.</p><ul class="pfeat"><li>Everything in Silver</li><li>Best available margins</li><li>Dedicated account manager</li><li>Custom solutions &amp; SLAs</li></ul><button class="buy-btn" type="button" (click)="apply()">Sign up</button></article></div>\r\n\r\n  <section class="brochure-section" aria-labelledby="partnership-types-title"><div class="pp-sec" id="partnership-types-title">Partnership Types</div><div class="partnership-types">\r\n    <article><div class="partner-cloud advisor"><img src="/assets/images/xcellhost-logo.png" alt="XcellHost Cloud Advisor" /><span>Cloud Advisor</span></div><h3>Cloud Advisor</h3><p>Recommend the right cloud solutions and earn on successful customer referrals.</p></article>\r\n    <article><div class="partner-cloud gold"><img src="/assets/images/xcellhost-logo.png" alt="XcellHost Gold Cloud Partner" /><span>Gold Cloud Partner</span></div><h3>Gold Cloud Partner</h3><p>Build recurring revenue with preferred margins, enablement and partner support.</p></article>\r\n    <article><div class="partner-cloud platinum"><img src="/assets/images/xcellhost-logo.png" alt="XcellHost Platinum Cloud Partner" /><span>Platinum Cloud Partner</span></div><h3>Platinum Cloud Partner</h3><p>Unlock premium margins, co-selling assistance and dedicated business guidance.</p></article>\r\n    <article><div class="partner-cloud distribution"><img src="/assets/images/xcellhost-logo.png" alt="XcellHost Distribution Partner" /><span>Distribution Partner</span></div><h3>Distribution Partner</h3><p>Scale XcellHost cloud services through your reseller and channel network.</p></article>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="brochure-section" aria-labelledby="top-services-title"><div class="pp-sec" id="top-services-title">Top 10 Selling Services</div><p class="pp-ov intro-note">Reliable, secure and scalable cloud services your customers already need.</p><div class="selling-services">\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">01</span><img src="/assets/images/hero-tally-on-cloud.png" alt="Tally on Cloud" /><h3>Tally on Cloud</h3><p>Secure, fast and reliable access from anywhere.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">02</span><div class="service-symbol" aria-hidden="true">FC</div><h3>File Cloud</h3><p>Secure file sharing, syncing and team collaboration.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">03</span><img src="/assets/images/acronis-backup-cloud.png" alt="Acronis Backup Cloud" /><h3>Acronis Backup Cloud</h3><p>Secure backup with ransomware protection and fast restore.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">04</span><img src="/assets/images/acronis-advanced-security-edr.png" alt="Acronis Advanced EDR" /><h3>Acronis Advanced EDR, XDR &amp; MDR</h3><p>Managed detection, response and threat monitoring.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">05</span><img src="/assets/images/hero-rmm.png" alt="Acronis Advanced RMM" /><h3>Acronis Advanced RMM</h3><p>Remote monitoring, patching and IT asset management.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">06</span><img src="/assets/images/acronis-disaster-recovery.png" alt="Acronis Disaster Recovery" /><h3>Acronis Disaster Recovery</h3><p>Business continuity with rapid failover and minimal downtime.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">07</span><img src="/assets/images/cybird-x2-product.png" alt="Cybird cybersecurity appliance" /><h3>Cybird Cyber Security Appliance</h3><p>All-in-one firewall, UTM, VPN and web filtering for SMBs.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">08</span><img src="/assets/images/hero-performance-cloud-v2.png" alt="Performance Cloud Servers" /><h3>Performance Cloud Servers</h3><p>High-performance, scalable servers with secure storage.</p></article>\r\n    <article><span class="service-number">09</span><div class="service-symbol" aria-hidden="true">BM</div><h3>Bare Metal Servers</h3><p>Dedicated resources, full root access and enterprise performance.</p></article>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="brochure-section reasons-section" aria-labelledby="top-reasons-title"><div class="pp-sec" id="top-reasons-title">Top 10 Reasons to Join XcellHost Cloud</div><div class="join-reasons">\r\n    <article><span>01</span><div><h3>High-margin cloud services</h3><p>Earn attractive margins across cloud, security, backup and infrastructure solutions.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Recurring revenue model</h3><p>Build predictable monthly income with subscription-based services.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Multi-product portfolio</h3><p>Sell cloud, security, backup, email and infrastructure from one platform.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Full cloud ecosystem</h3><p>Offer public cloud, private cloud and hybrid cloud solutions.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>05</span><div><h3>Advanced cybersecurity stack</h3><p>Deliver enterprise-grade EDR, XDR, MDR, DLP and SOC services.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>06</span><div><h3>SIEM-as-a-Service</h3><p>Provide managed security visibility, detection and compliance.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>07</span><div><h3>Backup-as-a-Service</h3><p>Protect customer data with secure and efficient cloud backup.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>08</span><div><h3>Disaster Recovery-as-a-Service</h3><p>Minimise downtime with rapid failover and business continuity.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>09</span><div><h3>Email security suite</h3><p>Defend customers from phishing, spam, malware and BEC attacks.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><span>10</span><div><h3>File cloud &amp; collaboration</h3><p>Enable secure file sharing, sync and teamwork from any device.</p></div></article>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">What you get as a partner</div><div class="pp-addons partner-benefits"><article class="pp-addon"><span class="aic partner-benefit-icon services-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/></svg></span><b>200+ services</b><p>Cloud, security, Microsoft 365, WhatsApp, email, domains and more.</p></article><article class="pp-addon"><span class="aic partner-benefit-icon pricing-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5h14M7 9h10M7 5c5.5 0 6 8 0 8h2l7 6"/></svg></span><b>Wholesale pricing</b><p>Buy at partner rates, set your own price and keep the margin.</p></article><article class="pp-addon"><span class="aic partner-benefit-icon brand-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 20 7v5c0 4.7-3.1 7.6-8 9-4.9-1.4-8-4.3-8-9V7l8-4Z"/><path d="m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.8-5"/></svg></span><b>White-label option</b><p>Your logo and name on the portal and invoices.</p></article><article class="pp-addon"><span class="aic partner-benefit-icon support-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 13v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><path d="M4 13h3v6H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-5Zm16 0h-3v6h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5ZM17 19c-1 2-3 2-5 2"/></svg></span><b>24\xD77 support</b><p>We handle infrastructure and support behind the scenes.</p></article></div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Why partners choose XcellHost</div><div class="pp-feats"><article class="pp-feat"><span class="fic blue">\u20B9</span><div><b>Recurring commissions</b><p>Earn on the first sale and on every renewal.</p></div></article><article class="pp-feat"><span class="fic green">1</span><div><b>One portal for everything</b><p>Provision services, manage clients, billing and earnings.</p></div></article><article class="pp-feat"><span class="fic orange">W</span><div><b>Your brand, our engine</b><p>White-label the experience while we work behind the scenes.</p></div></article><article class="pp-feat"><span class="fic blue">24</span><div><b>Dedicated partner support</b><p>Onboarding, pre-sales help and a team behind you.</p></div></article><article class="pp-feat"><span class="fic green">99</span><div><b>Trusted since 1999</b><p>ISO-certified, Microsoft Gold Partner infrastructure.</p></div></article><article class="pp-feat"><span class="fic orange">GST</span><div><b>GST-compliant billing</b><p>Local INR billing and GST invoices.</p></div></article></div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Inside the partner portal</div><p class="pp-ov intro-note">Everything you need to sell and manage in one place.</p><div class="reseller-tour-grid"><article><img src="/assets/images/reseller-tour-dashboard.svg" alt="XcellHost reseller partner dashboard"/><h3>Your partner dashboard</h3><p>Revenue, active clients, renewals and commissions at a glance.</p></article><article><img src="/assets/images/reseller-tour-catalogue.svg" alt="XcellHost reseller service catalogue"/><h3>Browse and sell 200+ products &amp; services</h3><p>Wholesale pricing and quick provisioning from one catalogue.</p></article><article><img src="/assets/images/reseller-tour-billing.svg" alt="XcellHost reseller clients and billing screen"/><h3>Clients, billing and white-label</h3><p>Manage customers, invoices, renewals and branding together.</p></article></div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Benefits for your business</div><div class="pp-bens business-benefits">\r\n    <article class="pb benefit-growth"><span class="ic business-benefit-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16"/><path d="m7 15 4-4 3 2 5-6"/><path d="M15 7h4v4"/></svg></span><b>New revenue, fast</b><p>Add cloud, security and AI without building products or infrastructure.</p></article>\r\n    <article class="pb benefit-income"><span class="ic business-benefit-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7Z"/><path d="M7 7V5h10v2M15 12h5M8 11h5M8 14h5"/><path d="M10 11c2.5 0 2.5 3 0 3h-1l3 3"/></svg></span><b>Recurring income</b><p>Earn on every eligible renewal, not just the first sale.</p></article>\r\n    <article class="pb benefit-brand"><span class="ic business-benefit-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 20 7v5c0 4.7-3.1 7.6-8 9-4.9-1.4-8-4.3-8-9V7l8-4Z"/><path d="M9 13.5c1.2-3.2 4-4.8 7-4.5-.2 3.6-2.2 6.3-5.5 7M9 17c0-2.5 1.2-4.6 3.5-6.2"/></svg></span><b>Own the relationship</b><p>White-label the service so customers see your brand.</p></article>\r\n    <article class="pb benefit-support"><span class="ic business-benefit-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 13v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><path d="M4 13h3v6H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-5Zm16 0h-3v6h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5ZM17 19c-1 2-3 2-5 2"/><path d="m10 9 2-2 2 2"/></svg></span><b>We do the heavy lifting</b><p>Infrastructure, uptime and 24\xD77 support are on us.</p></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">One partner. 200+ services to sell.</div><div class="reseller-panel"><div><h3>Everything in one place.</h3><p>Browse services, provision for a client, raise a GST invoice and watch your commissions build from the same dashboard.</p><ul><li>200+ services, one login</li><li>Provision in a few clicks</li><li>GST-compliant invoicing</li><li>Live commission tracking</li></ul></div><ol><li>Applied and approved \u2014 free</li><li>Portal and wholesale pricing live</li><li>Selling and earning commissions</li></ol></div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">From one-off sales to recurring revenue</div><div class="pp-cols"><p class="pp-ov">Selling alone means juggling vendors, thin one-off margins and supporting services you do not control. With XcellHost, one partner account gives you a full catalogue at wholesale prices, your brand on top and commissions that renew every month.</p><p class="pp-ov">The result: more to sell, better margins and revenue that keeps coming \u2014 without the overhead.</p></div>\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Who the program is for</div><div class="pp-uses partner-audiences">\r\n    <article class="pu audience-it"><span class="audience-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4M7 9l2 2 3-3"/></svg></span><b>IT service providers</b><small>Add cloud &amp; security</small></article>\r\n    <article class="pu audience-agency"><span class="audience-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 16 9-9 4 4-9 9H4v-4Z"/><path d="m13 7 2-2 4 4-2 2M5 5h4M7 3v4M16 17h5M18.5 14.5v5"/></svg></span><b>Digital agencies</b><small>Bundle cloud with your work</small></article>\r\n    <article class="pu audience-msp"><span class="audience-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M3 20v-2a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v2M13 19a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v1"/></svg></span><b>MSPs &amp; consultants</b><small>Resell what clients need</small></article>\r\n    <article class="pu audience-hosting"><span class="audience-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="4" y="14" width="16" height="7" rx="2"/><path d="M8 6.5h.01M8 17.5h.01M12 6.5h5M12 17.5h5"/></svg></span><b>Web &amp; hosting firms</b><small>Extend your catalogue</small></article>\r\n    <article class="pu audience-telecom"><span class="audience-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 20h14M8 20l4-16 4 16M9.5 14h5M10.5 9h3"/><path d="M5.5 6.5a9 9 0 0 0 0 7M18.5 6.5a9 9 0 0 1 0 7"/></svg></span><b>Telecom &amp; ISPs</b><small>Value-added services</small></article>\r\n    <article class="pu audience-integrator"><span class="audience-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3H3v6h6V3Zm12 0h-6v6h6V3ZM9 15H3v6h6v-6Zm12 0h-6v6h6v-6Z"/><path d="M9 6h6M6 9v6M18 9v6M9 18h6"/></svg></span><b>System integrators</b><small>One vendor for it all</small></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">What every partner gets</div><div class="pp-secrows"><article class="psr"><span class="si">1</span><div><b>Partner portal &amp; catalogue</b><p>One login to browse, provision and manage 200+ services.</p></div></article><article class="psr"><span class="si">\u20B9</span><div><b>Wholesale pricing &amp; 